# Backtest artifacts. The price cache is deliberately ignored: it is reproducible
# via `xsbt fetch`, and checking in a few MB of vendor data is not our job.
# Anchored with a leading slash: an unanchored `data/` also matches src/xsbt/data.
/data/
/runs/
/reports/

